    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabushCats</strong> is a pixel-art, top-down simulation game with elements of combat. Take on the role of a wholesome grandma who runs a shelter for cats living in the neighborhood. Expand and customize your home as the number of your lovely pets grows. At night, prepare to battle your cats' nightmares and stop them from disturbing their sleep! Defeat mysterious nightmare bosses and find your ultimate cat companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care of love-starved kittens!</strong> Feed them their favourite food, wash them carefully and watch their trust level rise. Each need comes with its unique interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/Healing.gif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your house! </strong>Unlock new rooms with special appliances as cats get more demanding over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover special cat abilities! </strong>Each cat comes with set of abilities that can be unlocked by earning their trust and are later used when facing nightmares.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/fafe2246e345d687b573ed1213061624.avif?t=1743526223\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight hundreds of nightmares! </strong>When night falls, Babushka has to face her cats' nightmares to help them sleep peacefully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own arsenal! </strong>Try unusual combinations of skills and weapons, match them to your playstyle. Water guns or maybe a YARN LAUNCHER?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat 3 monstrous Bosses! </strong>Face cats' biggest fears and free your kittens from the disturbance of their dreams!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/ad7c6891ff822958ce8b49dca00f3ea1.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabushCats</strong> is a pixel-art, top-down simulation game with elements of combat. Take on the role of a wholesome grandma who runs a shelter for cats living in the neighborhood. Expand and customize your home as the number of your lovely pets grows. At night, prepare to battle your cats' nightmares and stop them from disturbing their sleep! Defeat mysterious nightmare bosses and find your ultimate cat companionship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care of love-starved kittens!</strong> Feed them their favourite food, wash them carefully and watch their trust level rise. Each need comes with its unique interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/Healing.gif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your house! </strong>Unlock new rooms with special appliances as cats get more demanding over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/9cb230b827a8fd35537fc92640608abe.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover special cat abilities! </strong>Each cat comes with set of abilities that can be unlocked by earning their trust and are later used when facing nightmares.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/fafe2246e345d687b573ed1213061624.avif?t=1743526223\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight hundreds of nightmares! </strong>When night falls, Babushka has to face her cats' nightmares to help them sleep peacefully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.poster.avif?t=1743526223\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.webm?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923270/extras/66c90055a92c5e573586f0d5958df279.mp4?t=1743526223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own arsenal! </strong>Try unusual combinations of skills and weapons, match them to your playstyle. Water guns or maybe a YARN LAUNCHER?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat 3 monstrous Bosses! </strong>Face cats' biggest fears and free your kittens from the disturbance of their dreams!</p></li></ul>",
